  "description": "Introducing the Porter 14, a premium first pedal bike designed to bring mountain bike spirit to the youngest riders. With a frame inspired by true MTB geometry, it delivers confident handling, stability, and control, giving kids the perfect platform to master their first real cycling adventures.\nSafety and performance are at the forefront. Equipped with powerful Tektro brakes featuring levers modulated for smaller hands, young riders enjoy consistent and reliable stopping power on every ride. A nylon strap handlebar retainer helps keep the cockpit in place in the event of a fall, while the sturdy kickstand makes parking simple and hassle-free.\nRolling on durable wheels with sealed bearing hubs, this bike ensures smooth performance with minimal maintenance. The setup is built to last, handling everything from neighborhood rides to light off-road trails.\nBeyond function, the vibrant yellow design makes the bike stand out, sparking excitement and pride every time it’s ridden. Every detail has been carefully considered to balance durability, safety, and fun, creating a bike that grows with confidence.\nThe Porter 14' is more than just a kids’ bike—it’s their gateway to the joy, freedom, and adventure of cycling.",
